WEBVTT

01:41.920 --> 01:49.009
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.110 --> 01:51.830
[Episode 1]

02:11.740 --> 02:12.900
The scorching sun,

02:15.240 --> 02:16.680
the balmy sea breeze,

02:17.800 --> 02:19.200
and the refreshing waves

02:20.190 --> 02:22.850
keep this city looking like summer
all the time.

02:34.000 --> 02:35.660
After my college graduation,

02:35.780 --> 02:38.079
I chose to pursue a doctoral degree
on campus

02:38.079 --> 02:39.280
and stay in this city.

02:41.079 --> 02:42.940
Perhaps, subconsciously, I felt

02:43.960 --> 02:45.560
that as long as I stayed here,

02:46.460 --> 02:48.060
that summer from yesteryear

02:49.680 --> 02:51.090
would never end.

03:01.580 --> 03:03.120
Have you familiarized yourself
with the themed presentation

03:03.120 --> 03:04.470
you'll give in a few days?

03:04.470 --> 03:05.240
Yes, it's all set.

03:05.240 --> 03:07.100
I'm ready to get on stage anytime.

03:10.530 --> 03:12.590
Electronic devices
are highly affordable nowadays.

03:12.590 --> 03:14.360
If you like this kind of digital watch,

03:14.360 --> 03:16.230
why not replace it with a smart band?

03:16.230 --> 03:18.360
It can track your sleep and heart rate.

03:20.190 --> 03:21.120
It's different.

03:22.360 --> 03:23.290
You have no idea.

03:23.960 --> 03:25.060
This watch

03:25.400 --> 03:27.260
used to have stars on its display.

03:28.240 --> 03:29.700
But it broke two years ago.

03:29.800 --> 03:32.200
Who would wear a watch
that can't tell time?

03:33.960 --> 03:34.430
I would.

03:42.590 --> 03:44.590
When Jiang Yubai gave me this watch,

03:45.079 --> 03:45.780
he said

03:46.710 --> 03:48.460
he had an identical one.

03:52.150 --> 03:54.610
When the two watches
approached each other,

03:54.680 --> 03:56.090
shining stars

03:56.410 --> 03:58.210
would appear on the dial plates.

04:03.020 --> 04:05.180
Although mine no longer tells time,

04:06.120 --> 04:07.850
and the owner of the other watch

04:08.530 --> 04:10.390
already vanished into the crowd,

04:11.280 --> 04:13.020
I'm still wearing it,

04:14.250 --> 04:16.250
as if I'm carrying a silent universe

04:16.950 --> 04:18.010
on the wrist.

04:19.980 --> 04:20.980
But, Jiang Yubai,

04:21.890 --> 04:24.220
we have been out of contact
for five years.

04:26.360 --> 04:27.620
Where on earth are you?

04:32.170 --> 04:35.500
[Qingbei University]

04:32.870 --> 04:33.680
Have you heard?

04:33.680 --> 04:34.830
Today, Dr. Lin from our university

04:34.830 --> 04:36.090
will give us a lecture.

04:36.680 --> 04:37.240
Really?

04:37.560 --> 04:40.890
I heard she was recommended
for admission to our univesity.

04:43.159 --> 04:44.020
Here she comes.

04:48.920 --> 04:50.510
Ms. Lin is so pretty.

04:48.970 --> 04:50.130
[Qingbei University]

04:50.950 --> 04:51.870
She really is.

04:52.430 --> 04:53.750
She's not only an overachieving scholar

04:53.750 --> 04:55.950
as I expected, but also a gorgeous lady.

04:57.100 --> 04:57.550
[Qingbei University]

04:57.600 --> 04:58.990
[Quantum Bits and Computers]

04:59.310 --> 05:00.680
Today's lecture is about

05:00.680 --> 05:02.280
quantum bits and computers.

05:02.630 --> 05:05.330
A classical computer bit is like a switch—

05:05.570 --> 05:06.570
it's either 0 or 1.

05:07.370 --> 05:08.300
But a quantum bit,

05:08.300 --> 05:09.160
on the other hand,

05:09.160 --> 05:11.610
is more like a spinning top rotating
in two opposite directions simultaneously.

05:11.610 --> 05:14.180
[The superposition state of a qubit]

05:12.070 --> 05:13.660
Mathematics has demonstrated

05:13.660 --> 05:15.360
that such superposition

05:14.200 --> 05:16.900
[The perfect description in math]

05:15.560 --> 05:17.090
can be perfectly described

05:17.240 --> 05:18.900
by a vector in a Hilbert space.

05:37.510 --> 05:38.480
What's going on?

05:39.720 --> 05:40.610
[Quantum Bits and Computers]

05:44.750 --> 05:46.350
On this ordinary afternoon,

05:46.980 --> 05:49.240
the stars surprisingly showed up again.

05:50.370 --> 05:52.300
The slight heat from the dial plate

05:52.570 --> 05:53.770
resembles the warmth

05:54.560 --> 05:57.020
that has never cooled down
deep in my memory.

06:00.480 --> 06:02.680
You told me that you wouldn't be far away

06:03.160 --> 06:05.160
as long as the stars were sparkling.

06:06.240 --> 06:06.970
Jiang Yubai,

06:07.980 --> 06:09.580
have you always been around?

06:10.570 --> 06:11.450
Have you

06:14.540 --> 06:15.570
never ever left?

06:16.620 --> 06:20.710
[The year of 2004]

06:23.820 --> 06:25.780
[Class 1, Grade 4]

06:27.430 --> 06:28.180
Everyone,

06:28.360 --> 06:30.310
today, we'll learn an ancient poem

06:30.310 --> 06:32.909
titled
"Sitting Alone on Jingting Mountain."

06:32.930 --> 06:33.860
I will read it once,

06:33.860 --> 06:35.390
and you'll repeat after me.

06:36.870 --> 06:39.070
"Sitting Alone on Jingting Mountain."

06:39.420 --> 06:42.100
"Sitting Alone on Jingting Mountain."

06:42.540 --> 06:44.540
Written by Li Bai from Tang Dynasty.

06:45.390 --> 06:47.050
Humans are social creatures.

06:47.800 --> 06:49.930
This is common biological knowledge.

06:50.560 --> 06:52.360
But before I grew to 10 years old,

06:52.360 --> 06:53.760
the date of my social life

06:53.920 --> 06:55.770
had always been unusual.

07:02.500 --> 07:03.620
Mom, I finished the calculation.

07:03.620 --> 07:06.040
I could do mental math
for a supermarket's daily cash flow

07:06.040 --> 07:06.980
with zero error.

07:08.740 --> 07:10.200
Within 30 seconds, I could

07:10.680 --> 07:12.940
solve the final Math Olympiad question.

07:13.740 --> 07:14.800
What baffled me was

07:15.330 --> 07:17.990
why all the others
could make friends so easily.

07:18.860 --> 07:20.260
Even after a nasty brawl,

07:20.450 --> 07:22.050
they could get chummy again.

07:22.980 --> 07:24.690
But in all my years of school,

07:25.450 --> 07:27.130
I didn't even have a desk mate.

07:51.040 --> 07:53.370
It was the first time
I saw a shooting star.

07:53.800 --> 07:54.950
At that very moment,

07:56.540 --> 07:57.890
I made a wish.

07:58.159 --> 08:00.980
I want to be a strong
and optimistic person.

08:01.830 --> 08:03.630
I also want to have a good friend—

08:04.010 --> 08:05.940
someone who gets me and has my back,

08:06.180 --> 08:07.580
for whom I'll do the same.

08:11.510 --> 08:13.370
I hope my wish will soon come true.

08:14.930 --> 08:17.130
Little did I expect that after that day,

08:17.360 --> 08:18.500
there was really

08:19.220 --> 08:20.830
a change in my life.

08:22.750 --> 08:25.930
[Fourth Grade Office]

08:23.800 --> 08:24.890
Ms. Wu, look,

08:25.330 --> 08:28.480
this is Yubai's transcript
from when he studied in Singapore.

08:28.480 --> 08:29.610
He got straight A's.

08:32.100 --> 08:34.120
What an outstanding student Yubai is.

08:34.120 --> 08:36.580
Ms. Wu, I settle for nothing
less than first.

08:40.650 --> 08:41.770
How ambitious.

08:43.169 --> 08:43.980
However,

08:44.169 --> 08:45.500
it's no easy task to take

08:45.620 --> 08:47.150
first place in this school.

08:47.740 --> 08:49.410
Ms. Wu, I'll work hard.

08:51.880 --> 08:56.040
[Name: Lin Zhixia] [Grade: 4] [Rank: 1]

08:55.440 --> 08:56.530
Alright, class.

08:56.670 --> 08:57.800
Quiet down, please.

08:57.840 --> 08:59.080
I have an announcement to make.

08:59.080 --> 09:00.410
A new transfer student

09:00.510 --> 09:02.620
will join us in this semester.

09:02.840 --> 09:04.390
His name is Jiang Yubai.

09:05.080 --> 09:06.860
So your name's from this verse,
"Against the blue river, the birds

09:06.860 --> 09:09.720
appear more white; Amid the green hills,
the flowers blaze with light."

09:09.720 --> 09:10.750
Jiang Yubai

09:10.750 --> 09:13.870
spent three years attending
elementary school in Singapore.

09:13.870 --> 09:15.500
If he ever meets a problem,

09:15.960 --> 09:18.270
should you or should you not help him?

09:18.480 --> 09:20.200
We should.

09:21.080 --> 09:22.200
Alright, Jiang Yubai,

09:22.200 --> 09:23.460
take a seat over there.

09:29.030 --> 09:30.910
Everyone, take out your textbooks.

09:30.910 --> 09:32.110
The class begins now.

09:52.080 --> 09:53.610
Why don't you say anything?

09:56.860 --> 09:58.080
Hello.

09:59.280 --> 10:00.480
My name is...

10:01.200 --> 10:04.390
Jiang... Jiang... Jiang... Jiang...

10:04.870 --> 10:05.670
Jiang Yubai.

10:07.620 --> 10:11.010
"Jiang Jiang Jiang Jiang Yubai"?

10:13.620 --> 10:14.340
Then you may call me

10:14.340 --> 10:15.960
"Lin Lin Lin Lin Lin Zhixia."

10:19.750 --> 10:21.600
Midterm exams are next week.

10:21.820 --> 10:23.340
Make sure you review the lessons well
this weekend.

10:23.340 --> 10:24.030
Got it?

10:24.370 --> 10:26.410
Got it.

10:26.620 --> 10:27.500
Class dismissed.

10:27.500 --> 10:28.200
Stand up.

10:28.460 --> 10:31.580
Goodbye, Ms. Wu.

10:42.370 --> 10:43.170
Lin Zhixia,

10:43.740 --> 10:46.000
I'll outscore you in the upcoming tests.

10:48.130 --> 10:49.720
Are you saying

10:49.820 --> 10:51.550
that you'll definitely beat me

10:51.740 --> 10:54.200
in the upcoming midterm exams
and rank first

10:54.290 --> 10:55.150
in the grade?

10:56.460 --> 10:58.750
This time, I will definitely...

11:00.820 --> 11:02.020
I mean, I'll probably

11:02.410 --> 11:03.220
and possibly

11:05.650 --> 11:07.310
take first place in the grade.

11:08.580 --> 11:09.390
Jiang Yubai,

11:09.600 --> 11:11.080
we just became desk mates.

11:11.440 --> 11:12.700
I don't think you have

11:12.700 --> 11:14.700
a thorough understanding of me yet.

11:20.340 --> 11:21.150
How about this?

11:21.150 --> 11:22.080
Let's make a bet.

11:22.250 --> 11:24.100
If you end up ranking first in the grade,

11:24.100 --> 11:25.620
I'll call you "Mr. Jiang."

11:25.890 --> 11:27.480
But if I rise to top instead,

11:27.480 --> 11:29.100
you'll call me "Ms. Lin"

11:29.100 --> 11:29.940
as a gesture of respect.

11:29.940 --> 11:30.940
What do you think?

11:31.040 --> 11:31.650
I'm in.

11:32.170 --> 11:34.790
[Jiang Yubai]
[Score: 100] [Score: 100] [Score: 100]

11:37.370 --> 11:39.570
I guess I won't get to call you "Ms. Lin."

11:40.960 --> 11:42.030
What a pity.

11:42.840 --> 11:43.200
No.

11:44.000 --> 11:45.800
You'll have to call me "Ms. Lin."

11:46.000 --> 11:46.960
Lin Zhixia,

11:47.440 --> 11:48.720
I didn't lose to you.

11:50.980 --> 11:52.300
[Lin Zhixia]
[Score: 100] [Score: 100] [Score: 100]

11:52.320 --> 11:52.820
[Added: 5 extra points]

11:58.000 --> 11:58.910
I can't believe

11:58.910 --> 12:01.570
you wrote the final essay
in classical Chinese.

12:02.030 --> 12:03.150
Good for you!

12:06.750 --> 12:08.320
Ms. Lin.

12:09.200 --> 12:10.930
What? What did you just call me?

12:13.320 --> 12:15.220
Ms. Lin.

12:19.490 --> 12:21.530
[Class 1, Grade 4]

12:25.840 --> 12:26.840
I just flipped another one over!

12:26.840 --> 12:27.720
You're quick.

12:27.870 --> 12:29.270
Okay. Watch me!

12:31.530 --> 12:33.060
It was really flipped back.

12:33.530 --> 12:34.940
Can I play with you guys?

12:36.030 --> 12:37.170
No. Go away.

12:37.790 --> 12:38.580
Why?

12:38.960 --> 12:40.240
Because I said no.

12:40.360 --> 12:40.940
Scram.

12:46.240 --> 12:47.150
Ji Fa's army.

12:47.380 --> 12:49.040
I have two Shen Gongbao cards.

12:49.290 --> 12:49.960
I just flipped it.

12:49.960 --> 12:51.620
The contact area is too large.

12:51.720 --> 12:53.550
Try tapping the corner of the card.

12:53.550 --> 12:55.770
The chances of flipping it will be higher.

12:55.770 --> 12:57.030
I'll give it a try then.

12:57.550 --> 12:59.360
Lin Zhixia, aren't you being annoying?

12:59.360 --> 13:01.220
Go away, or I'll show you no mercy.

13:05.150 --> 13:06.580
It really flipped.

13:06.840 --> 13:08.580
This card is mine now!

13:11.750 --> 13:13.170
Lin Zhixia, you weirdo.

13:13.720 --> 13:15.320
You're not leaving, are you?

13:15.440 --> 13:16.960
Fine. We'll go play somewhere else!

13:16.960 --> 13:18.100
Come on, let's go.

13:47.320 --> 13:48.320
Did you make this?

13:50.120 --> 13:51.380
The paper planes I make

13:51.480 --> 13:52.870
always fly far and hit the target.

13:52.870 --> 13:54.320
In the school I used to go to,

13:54.320 --> 13:57.180
I even won first prize
in a paper plane competition.

13:58.080 --> 13:58.840
Impressive.

14:09.670 --> 14:12.100
Lin Zhixia, what's on your mind?

14:12.940 --> 14:13.670
Jiang Yubai,

14:13.740 --> 14:14.670
close your eyes.

14:19.290 --> 14:20.650
When your eyes are closed,

14:20.650 --> 14:22.870
your sense of hearing
becomes particularly sharp.

14:22.870 --> 14:25.290
You can tell the sound
of the wind, crackling leaves,

14:25.290 --> 14:26.950
and the chirping of sparrows.

14:27.050 --> 14:28.130
Now, I'm wondering

14:28.580 --> 14:30.440
if sparrows have consciousness.

14:31.360 --> 14:33.220
Why are you wondering about that?

14:34.980 --> 14:35.710
Jiang Yubai,

14:36.010 --> 14:38.270
have you ever thought about your origin?

14:38.550 --> 14:40.120
With your eyes closed,

14:40.460 --> 14:42.170
can you feel your true self?

14:42.980 --> 14:44.440
I often contemplate this:

14:44.500 --> 14:45.270
I am me,

14:45.620 --> 14:46.890
but who am I exactly?

14:47.370 --> 14:49.200
I've been bothered by this question
for a long time.

14:49.200 --> 14:50.460
I don't have an answer.

14:51.130 --> 14:52.500
Jiang Yubai, do you?

15:37.960 --> 15:38.820
Zeqiu, Zeqiu!

15:39.290 --> 15:39.700
Zeqiu!

15:40.170 --> 15:41.150
Zeqiu, I've got news.

15:41.150 --> 15:42.350
I have a desk mate now.

15:42.740 --> 15:45.070
He even initiates conversations
with me.

15:47.440 --> 15:49.270
Zeqiu, did you hear me?

15:49.270 --> 15:50.390
Yes, I did.

15:50.720 --> 15:51.980
You've got a desk mate.

15:52.080 --> 15:53.540
You're really bugging me.

15:53.700 --> 15:55.230
I need to do my homework now.

15:59.120 --> 16:01.720
Zeqiu, there's another way
to solve this question.

16:01.720 --> 16:02.780
It's much simpler.

16:03.100 --> 16:04.200
You think you know everything?

16:04.200 --> 16:05.360
I don't need you to tutor me.

16:05.360 --> 16:07.820
Then why don't you
go for a simpler solution?

16:07.960 --> 16:10.270
You should listen carefully
when others speak.

16:10.270 --> 16:11.730
My desk mate listens to me.

16:13.100 --> 16:15.460
Does he... understand what you say?

16:17.130 --> 16:18.330
No, not a single word.

16:19.080 --> 16:20.140
Alright. Alright.

16:20.220 --> 16:23.020
Whoever sits next to you
will end up getting crazy.

16:37.290 --> 16:38.130
It's physics.

16:39.500 --> 16:41.230
Can you understand that stuff?

16:41.860 --> 16:43.000
Of course I can.

16:44.000 --> 16:46.030
All I need is some more time.

16:47.170 --> 16:48.000
Jiang Yubai,

16:48.620 --> 16:51.770
maybe you should stay away
from Lin Zhixia.

16:52.620 --> 16:53.290
I think

16:53.530 --> 16:55.190
you're being infected by her.

16:55.360 --> 16:57.220
Lin Zhixia is not a virus.

16:57.530 --> 16:58.730
How can I be infected?

16:59.620 --> 17:01.250
It seems to me that the way you speak

17:01.250 --> 17:02.710
is more and more like hers.

17:02.840 --> 17:04.770
Before you completely turn into her,

17:04.770 --> 17:06.500
please get a new desk mate soon.

17:08.030 --> 17:09.230
We'll see about that.

17:09.750 --> 17:10.480
Jiang Yubai.

17:11.290 --> 17:13.010
Are you competing with Ding Yan

17:13.010 --> 17:15.410
for the position of Lin Zhixia's tagalong?

17:15.640 --> 17:16.550
The two of you

17:16.550 --> 17:18.609
are Tagalong No. 1 and Tagalong No. 2!

17:21.420 --> 17:22.220
I'm not!

17:22.569 --> 17:23.250
Look at

17:23.420 --> 17:24.480
that physics book.

17:24.500 --> 17:26.940
What elementary schooler studies physics?

17:26.940 --> 17:28.220
Only Lin Zhixia does.

17:28.329 --> 17:29.440
She's a weirdo.

17:29.570 --> 17:31.220
You're the weirdo's desk mate.

17:31.220 --> 17:32.460
You freaky tagalong!

17:35.740 --> 17:36.940
What did you just say?

17:38.420 --> 17:39.380
Jiang Yubai, what are you doing?

17:39.380 --> 17:40.310
You want a fight?

17:40.500 --> 17:41.700
Who's having a fight?

17:43.590 --> 17:45.050
Zhou Bufeng, Jiang Yubai,

17:45.180 --> 17:46.310
what were you doing?

17:46.770 --> 17:48.170
What got you into a fight?

17:50.090 --> 17:52.550
Speak up, or go stand outside
as punishment.

17:52.660 --> 17:53.860
You freaky tagalong.

17:56.500 --> 17:58.240
Jiang Yubai, tell me

17:58.570 --> 17:59.430
what happened.

17:59.720 --> 18:01.920
Ms. Wu, this is all that weirdo's fault.

18:02.770 --> 18:03.830
She's not a weirdo!

18:05.700 --> 18:07.160
Did I ask you, Zhou Bufeng?

18:25.790 --> 18:26.520
Jiang Yubai!

18:31.810 --> 18:32.540
Jiang Yubai,

18:32.920 --> 18:35.530
will you still be my desk mate?

18:36.220 --> 18:37.150
Of course I will.

18:37.960 --> 18:39.160
I won't be a deserter.

18:39.270 --> 18:41.810
Then I'd like to officially invite you
to be a specimen

18:41.810 --> 18:43.470
for my observation of humans.

18:43.920 --> 18:44.740
What?

18:45.350 --> 18:46.880
I've always wanted to figure out

18:46.880 --> 18:48.880
how ordinary people think and live.

18:49.940 --> 18:51.540
Since you transferred here,

18:51.590 --> 18:53.810
you've quickly fraternized with everyone,

18:53.810 --> 18:55.070
even including me.

18:56.260 --> 18:57.400
I'm wondering...

18:57.720 --> 18:59.980
if you were scared
when you spoke up for me just now.

18:59.980 --> 19:01.200
Were you angry when our classmates

19:01.200 --> 19:03.060
hurled those rude remarks at you?

19:04.010 --> 19:04.660
I...

19:04.660 --> 19:05.070
Also,

19:05.310 --> 19:06.640
when you came across something

19:06.640 --> 19:08.200
related to the Hilbert space,

19:08.200 --> 19:10.130
what was your immediate reaction?

19:10.400 --> 19:11.310
Among all classmates,

19:11.310 --> 19:13.200
only you would listen to me
as I bring up these topics,

19:13.200 --> 19:15.400
though you never understand what I say.

19:17.590 --> 19:19.640
In time, I will.

19:20.550 --> 19:21.680
Most importantly,

19:21.880 --> 19:24.510
Jiang Yubai, you are different
from any other classmate.

19:24.510 --> 19:26.400
That's why I'm so eager to study you.

19:26.400 --> 19:26.810
Look!

19:28.860 --> 19:29.350
[The Human Observation Diary
is a preliminary research review]

19:29.370 --> 19:29.910
[on ordinary humans' thinking modes.]

19:29.930 --> 19:30.560
[Through observing
the author's desk mate, Jiang Yubai]

19:30.350 --> 19:31.510
You want to study me

19:30.580 --> 19:31.090
[the author hopes to further explore
the mindsets of ordinary humans]

19:31.110 --> 19:31.670
[and the limitations
on their thinking patterns]

19:32.090 --> 19:34.550
because I am an ordinary human?

19:34.810 --> 19:35.290
Yes.

19:38.850 --> 19:39.510
Lin Zhixia,

19:40.720 --> 19:42.340
is your birthday coming up?

19:42.460 --> 19:43.260
Yes, in a week.

19:43.460 --> 19:44.850
Really? Well then...

19:45.300 --> 19:46.370
[Novel Questions for Physics Contests]

19:46.090 --> 19:47.750
Take all these books as a gift.

19:48.820 --> 19:49.250
[Novel Questions for Physics Contests]

19:49.270 --> 19:50.450
[Compilation of Questions
for Physics Contests]

19:50.450 --> 19:51.140
[Compilation of High-Frequency Questions
for Physics Contests]

19:55.640 --> 19:56.500
All of them?

19:56.850 --> 19:58.610
I've already read them through

19:58.850 --> 20:00.440
and got the gist.

20:00.610 --> 20:02.540
All the answer pages were torn out.

20:05.420 --> 20:06.200
Jiang Yubai,

20:06.530 --> 20:08.810
I can't believe you could master
so much knowledge

20:08.810 --> 20:10.380
without answer pages.

20:10.660 --> 20:11.830
You're amazing.

20:11.900 --> 20:13.510
I'm totally defeated by you.

20:17.660 --> 20:19.390
I've already read them through

20:19.570 --> 20:21.110
and got the gist.

20:21.980 --> 20:24.440
Besides, all the answer pages
were torn out.

20:26.980 --> 20:27.980
All were torn out?

20:28.200 --> 20:28.590
Yes.

20:29.010 --> 20:31.380
Not an answer page is left in each book.

20:31.960 --> 20:34.900
After all, I don't need answers.

20:44.920 --> 20:46.240
I-I'm sorry.

20:46.770 --> 20:49.090
Actually, Lin Zhixia,
I didn't throw the answer pages away.

20:49.090 --> 20:49.640
I'll give them to you tomorrow.

20:49.640 --> 20:50.370
Jiang Yubai,

20:51.770 --> 20:52.420
thank you.

20:56.290 --> 20:57.380
This is the first time I've received

20:57.380 --> 20:59.180
a birthday gift from a classmate.

20:59.180 --> 21:00.250
Purely unprecedented.

21:00.250 --> 21:01.980
No one has treated me like this.

21:02.250 --> 21:04.050
These are all my favorite books.

21:04.530 --> 21:06.130
Jiang Yubai, you're so nice.

21:06.530 --> 21:08.770
But the answer pages are gone.

21:09.090 --> 21:11.460
It's fine.
I never look at standard answers.

21:11.460 --> 21:12.380
The logic behind them

21:12.380 --> 21:14.380
is completely different from mine.

21:14.420 --> 21:15.850
All I want to do is find problems.

21:15.850 --> 21:17.350
Problems help me think.

21:17.740 --> 21:19.830
The process of thinking matters most.

21:19.830 --> 21:21.630
Jiang Yubai, you know me so well.

21:21.790 --> 21:22.740
Thank you again.

21:22.900 --> 21:25.160
This is the best gift I've ever received.

21:26.640 --> 21:28.240
Jiang Yubai, I announce,

21:28.610 --> 21:29.700
from now on,

21:29.700 --> 21:30.700
you are my friend,

21:30.810 --> 21:31.670
my best friend.

21:34.380 --> 21:37.330
Your best friend?

21:40.220 --> 21:42.270
This year's autumn trip
will take place at the aquarium

21:42.270 --> 21:43.070
this Saturday.

21:43.070 --> 21:44.670
The fee is 76 yuan per person.

21:45.030 --> 21:47.220
Tell your parents about it after school.

21:47.220 --> 21:48.750
If you're not going, let me know.

21:48.750 --> 21:49.310
Got it?

21:49.440 --> 21:50.550
Got it.

21:51.010 --> 21:52.290
Alright. Class dismissed.

21:52.290 --> 21:52.960
Stand up!

21:53.110 --> 21:56.270
Goodbye, Ms. Wu.

21:59.090 --> 22:01.160
Alright, let's keep moving forward.

22:01.290 --> 22:02.680
See the silver fish here?

22:02.680 --> 22:03.740
What are they called?

22:03.740 --> 22:05.670
It's called "silver dollar fish."

22:08.310 --> 22:09.740
Come on, keep up.

22:11.700 --> 22:12.360
Lin Zhixia,

22:12.590 --> 22:13.810
you two had better not fall behind.

22:13.810 --> 22:14.810
Keep up with us!

22:17.530 --> 22:18.260
Jiang Yubai,

22:18.420 --> 22:19.510
he just spoke to me.

22:19.980 --> 22:21.850
You're happy when someone speaks to you?

22:21.850 --> 22:22.250
Yes.

22:22.570 --> 22:24.770
I think he wants to make friends with me.

22:26.220 --> 22:27.220
Didn't you say

22:27.330 --> 22:28.830
I am your best friend?

22:29.180 --> 22:29.680
Yes,

22:29.810 --> 22:30.530
you are.

22:30.990 --> 22:33.250
But I also want to have more good friends.

22:36.010 --> 22:36.810
Well...

22:37.900 --> 22:39.010
That's a chubby fish.

22:39.010 --> 22:40.210
Is "chubby" its name?

22:40.220 --> 22:41.810
No, this is the humphead wrasse,

22:41.810 --> 22:43.500
belonging to class Actinopterygii,
the order Perciformes,

22:43.500 --> 22:45.700
the suborder Labroidei,
and the family Labridae.

22:45.700 --> 22:46.900
It can be found mainly

22:46.900 --> 22:49.160
in the Indian Ocean to the Pacific Ocean.

22:49.180 --> 22:50.670
It has a mild temperament.

22:50.810 --> 22:52.570
An adorable kind of fish, I'd say.

22:52.570 --> 22:54.030
It's not called "chubby."

22:56.310 --> 22:58.790
But I still consider it chubby.

23:04.640 --> 23:06.100
This one's even chubbier.

23:10.850 --> 23:11.780
Professor Shen.

23:12.350 --> 23:14.590
The coral reproduction in the aquarium
has been less than ideal,

23:14.590 --> 23:16.350
with a high mortality rate of larvae.

23:16.350 --> 23:17.200
We suspect

23:17.480 --> 23:19.310
there are unstable internal water flows

23:19.310 --> 23:21.910
with unpredictable local micro-turbulence.

23:22.200 --> 23:23.920
It's quite a tricky issue.

23:23.920 --> 23:25.750
We really don't have a clue.

23:25.880 --> 23:27.440
"Micro-turbulence"?

23:27.740 --> 23:28.550
What is that?

23:28.920 --> 23:32.110
Suppose you're stirring a cup of water
quickly and randomly,

23:32.110 --> 23:33.920
the irregular and hard-to-see vortices

23:33.920 --> 23:35.510
generated therein

23:35.880 --> 23:37.610
are called micro-turbulence.

23:37.680 --> 23:39.830
It's just like an invisible stirring rod.

23:39.830 --> 23:42.030
Then what does it have to do with corals?

23:42.070 --> 23:43.640
Mature corals may not fear it.

23:43.640 --> 23:45.640
But for baby corals,

23:46.200 --> 23:48.110
getting bumped around all the time

23:48.110 --> 23:50.640
is like experiencing earthquakes
every day.

23:50.810 --> 23:53.720
This way, they won't be able to
settle down and grow.

23:53.720 --> 23:54.480
Little girl,

23:54.750 --> 23:56.510
do you have any ideas as to

23:56.510 --> 23:58.240
how this problem can be solved?

23:59.510 --> 24:01.550
By installing artificial coral reefs,
I suppose.

24:01.550 --> 24:03.880
When micro-turbulence passes
through the reefs,

24:03.880 --> 24:05.830
it'll be broken down
into gentler currents,

24:05.830 --> 24:07.060
reducing the damage.

24:07.240 --> 24:09.480
Plus, The cavities and leeward sides

24:09.480 --> 24:10.480
of these artificial reefs

24:10.480 --> 24:11.550
will create

24:11.550 --> 24:14.200
a still-water zone
where the current is almost zero,

24:14.200 --> 24:16.730
and hence offer a safe haven
for coral larvae.

24:17.590 --> 24:18.350
In other words,

24:18.350 --> 24:20.440
from the perspective
of energy dissipation,

24:20.440 --> 24:21.790
building a buffer structure

24:21.790 --> 24:24.190
is a simple and effective solution, right?

24:28.010 --> 24:29.250
How old are you?

24:29.440 --> 24:30.440
What's your name?

24:30.830 --> 24:31.920
My name is Lin Zhixia.

24:31.920 --> 24:33.290
I'm in fourth grade.

24:34.290 --> 24:35.510
Alright, Lin Zhixia.

24:36.570 --> 24:38.330
This is my business card.

24:38.720 --> 24:40.960
If you are truly interested in the ocean,

24:40.960 --> 24:43.490
you're welcome to visit my lab
on the weekend.

24:44.570 --> 24:46.830
Professor Shen, I have read your papers.

24:47.030 --> 24:48.830
This is my best friend, Jiang Yubai.

24:48.830 --> 24:50.750
Can I bring him along to your lab?

24:51.050 --> 24:52.030
Yes, of course.

24:54.330 --> 24:55.480
Our teacher is waiting for us.

24:55.480 --> 24:56.940
Professor Shen, we have to go now.

24:56.940 --> 24:57.660
See you.

24:57.980 --> 24:58.660
See you.

25:23.810 --> 25:24.900
Jiang Yubai, look.

25:30.310 --> 25:31.110
Jiang Yubai,

25:31.720 --> 25:35.010
look, the anglerfish is even uglier
than it appears in the book.

25:35.010 --> 25:35.640
It...

25:37.830 --> 25:38.590
Jiang Yubai?

25:40.530 --> 25:41.260
Jiang Yubai?

25:43.160 --> 25:43.890
Jiang Yubai!

26:08.050 --> 26:08.830
Jiang Yubai!

26:10.440 --> 26:11.270
Ms. Wu!

26:13.570 --> 26:14.530
Where are you?

26:17.940 --> 26:20.810
Lin Zhixia, look!
What kind of fish is this?

26:23.980 --> 26:24.700
Lin Zhixia?

26:26.250 --> 26:27.050
Lin Zhixia!

26:48.480 --> 26:49.660
The distance between here and the exit

26:49.660 --> 26:51.060
is no more than 20 meters.

26:51.590 --> 26:52.350
I can make it.

26:53.610 --> 26:54.670
I can make it there.

27:14.720 --> 27:16.030
Lin Zhixia!

27:41.310 --> 27:42.310
Are you crying?

27:45.830 --> 27:47.960
Giant manta rays are not cute at all.

27:50.640 --> 27:53.550
Come on. Let's go find our classmates
and teacher.

28:02.500 --> 28:04.440
Come on, I'll lead the way.

28:05.630 --> 28:09.050
♪ Let's run away ♪

28:15.760 --> 28:18.330
♪ No turn to black ♪

28:19.150 --> 28:23.110
♪ Your love will carry us
through the night ♪

28:24.750 --> 28:28.020
♪ You and I ♪

28:29.290 --> 28:32.650
♪ Long last night ♪

28:34.300 --> 28:37.190
♪ You and I ♪

28:36.460 --> 28:37.480
Get a move on. Time to assemble!

28:37.480 --> 28:38.660
We're going to take photos.

28:38.660 --> 28:39.270
Hurry up, kids!

28:39.270 --> 28:40.050
Hurry up.

28:40.090 --> 28:42.020
Jiang Yubai, Lin Zhixia, be quick!

28:42.160 --> 28:43.610
Come on. Start running already.

28:43.610 --> 28:45.090
Gather around. Stand in three rows.

28:45.090 --> 28:46.220
Three rows. Pick your own spot.

28:46.220 --> 28:47.550
Listen to me. Get ready.

28:47.810 --> 28:50.940
Three, two, one, cheese!

28:51.350 --> 28:53.590
Cheese!

29:06.270 --> 29:07.050
Ms. Shen.

29:08.240 --> 29:10.500
Is Lin Zhixia highly talented?

29:12.830 --> 29:14.070
Yes, she's very talented.

29:14.070 --> 29:16.530
And she's gifted
in a way that few people are.

29:21.680 --> 29:22.510
It's a compliment for her.

29:22.510 --> 29:23.810
Why are you so happy?

29:25.070 --> 29:25.940
Well,

29:26.270 --> 29:27.640
having a strong rival

29:28.440 --> 29:30.640
means I'm strong too, right?

29:32.470 --> 29:34.940
Right. When you grow up,

29:34.940 --> 29:36.200
you'll come to realize

29:36.200 --> 29:38.160
that having friends and rivals

29:38.680 --> 29:40.920
is a blessing in life.

29:52.000 --> 29:52.660
Lin Zhixia,

29:53.070 --> 29:53.870
you know what?

29:54.270 --> 29:57.670
When high-energy particles collide,
new matter is created.

29:57.790 --> 29:58.450
I know that.

29:58.790 --> 30:01.030
In the instant of collision
between protons running at light speed,

30:01.030 --> 30:02.240
each carrying its total energy,

30:02.240 --> 30:03.400
what bursts forth is not destruction,

30:03.400 --> 30:04.610
but a brand new star.

30:05.400 --> 30:06.400
Let's do that too.

30:07.920 --> 30:08.380
What?

30:11.070 --> 30:12.200
I mean,

30:13.000 --> 30:15.250
confrontation and collaboration

30:15.510 --> 30:17.200
are essentially a double helix.

30:17.200 --> 30:19.660
How about we work hard together
for an admission

30:19.660 --> 30:21.390
to the best junior high school?

30:24.270 --> 30:26.800
Jiang Yubai, do you know
about time capsules?

30:27.070 --> 30:28.160
Time capsules?

30:29.680 --> 30:31.160
Let's write down our wishes.

30:31.160 --> 30:33.510
When we get to junior high,
we'll come back and open the capsules.

30:33.510 --> 30:34.510
What do you think?

30:36.460 --> 30:37.260
Teachers said

30:37.660 --> 30:39.990
that a plant's growth relies on sunshine.

30:40.200 --> 30:43.800
I think Jiang Yubai and I grew up
relying on each other's support.

30:45.070 --> 30:46.240
He told me jokes,

30:46.900 --> 30:48.560
and I tutored him on theorems.

30:49.270 --> 30:50.420
It was like two leaves

30:50.420 --> 30:52.280
sharing the same ray of sunshine.

30:55.200 --> 30:57.200
When we buried the capsules, he said

30:57.440 --> 30:59.610
we'd bask in the sun again together.

31:00.610 --> 31:01.870
We promised each other

31:02.070 --> 31:03.930
that we would remain best friends

31:04.290 --> 31:07.220
for longer than forever.

31:11.440 --> 31:14.680
[Examination Seating Arrangement]

31:14.680 --> 31:15.330
[Fourth to sixth grade]

31:18.700 --> 31:19.310
Great!

31:19.480 --> 31:21.090
We'll be in the same exam room.

31:21.090 --> 31:21.660
That's wonderful.

31:21.340 --> 31:22.610
[Examination Seating Arrangement]

31:28.410 --> 31:29.140
Jiang Yubai!

31:30.610 --> 31:31.920
Jiang Yubai, there you are.

31:31.920 --> 31:34.780
You know what? We are assigned
to the same exam room.

31:36.660 --> 31:38.850
Yubai, hurry! We need to go now.

31:39.570 --> 31:40.920
Mom, give me a second!

31:44.500 --> 31:46.300
Jiang Yubai, what's the matter?

31:49.200 --> 31:51.090
I-I'm sorry.

31:51.660 --> 31:52.380
Lin Zhixia,

31:53.010 --> 31:54.740
I can't take the exam.

31:55.460 --> 31:56.330
I'm moving

31:57.740 --> 31:59.070
to another city.

32:00.460 --> 32:01.610
Do you mean

32:02.250 --> 32:04.250
we can't go to junior high together?

32:07.610 --> 32:10.160
Yubai, we're heading to the airport.

32:10.400 --> 32:11.570
Say bye to your classmate now.

32:11.480 --> 32:15.390
♪ With every breath, the shadows creep ♪

32:14.290 --> 32:15.420
My mom is rushing me.

32:15.530 --> 32:16.200
I have to go.

32:18.380 --> 32:21.580
♪ The devil in disguise ♪

32:19.850 --> 32:21.090
This is my QQ number.

32:21.380 --> 32:22.980
Make sure you send me a friend request.

32:22.980 --> 32:26.040
♪ Talking the sweetest lies ♪

32:29.950 --> 32:33.520
♪ It tries to drown me in my sleep ♪

32:34.770 --> 32:35.500
Jiang Yubai!

32:36.170 --> 32:39.620
♪ And comes like a tide ♪

32:38.610 --> 32:41.070
Lin Zhixia, we'll meet again.

32:40.840 --> 32:45.440
♪ It hurts, but I'm too tired to hide ♪

32:41.160 --> 32:42.690
I haven't defeated you yet!

32:46.090 --> 32:50.950
♪ Please hold me, help me
walk out of this endless night ♪

32:51.360 --> 32:52.640
♪ Lost the light and power ♪

32:52.890 --> 32:55.490
♪ Lost my will to fight ♪

32:55.900 --> 32:59.100
♪ Can you stay by my side ♪

32:56.420 --> 32:59.000
Didn't we agree
to go to junior high together?

32:59.500 --> 33:02.330
We promised to go to junior high together.

33:00.300 --> 33:03.180
♪ Be my light knight ♪

33:04.500 --> 33:07.250
♪ Let's run away ♪

33:07.330 --> 33:08.290
Jiang Yubai...

33:14.290 --> 33:16.900
♪ Towards the light ♪

33:14.460 --> 33:15.460
Jiang Yubai said,

33:16.550 --> 33:18.240
if parallel universes truly exist,

33:18.040 --> 33:20.880
♪ With you, I'll win this fight ♪

33:19.790 --> 33:21.440
then we would be friends

33:22.250 --> 33:23.380
in each universe.

33:22.800 --> 33:26.130
♪ Let's run away ♪

33:24.330 --> 33:27.790
We promised to bathe in the sun together
every day from then on.

33:32.970 --> 33:35.270
♪ No turn to black ♪

33:36.370 --> 33:40.110
♪ Your love will carry us
through the night ♪

33:37.330 --> 33:39.730
I thought the sun would never
take a day off.

33:40.740 --> 33:41.960
But that summer,

33:41.960 --> 33:45.230
♪ You and I ♪

33:43.180 --> 33:44.310
it took a long leave.

33:45.770 --> 33:47.460
My best friend, Jiang Yubai,

33:46.410 --> 33:49.860
♪ Long last night ♪

33:48.680 --> 33:50.220
disappeared from my world.

33:51.180 --> 33:54.190
♪ You and I ♪

33:54.890 --> 33:58.070
♪ Will eventually start a new life ♪

34:03.170 --> 34:06.170
[Five years later]

34:24.690 --> 34:25.300
Zhixia,

34:26.130 --> 34:27.929
school starts tomorrow, right?

34:28.300 --> 34:30.860
I just fetched some new stationary
from my family's store.

34:30.860 --> 34:31.300
Okay.

35:18.380 --> 35:18.880
Zeqiu.

35:26.030 --> 35:28.480
Knocking on the door
is a way to ask for permission.

35:28.480 --> 35:30.030
But before I granted it, you already

35:30.030 --> 35:30.880
barged into my room.

35:30.880 --> 35:33.010
What's the point of all that knocking?

35:37.480 --> 35:38.130
Speak up.

35:39.250 --> 35:40.710
I want to use the computer.

35:41.110 --> 35:41.630
No.

35:44.210 --> 35:45.770
Please let me use it for a bit.

35:45.770 --> 35:46.670
Not a chance.

35:48.280 --> 35:50.050
I'm begging you.
Please let me use it for a bit.

35:50.050 --> 35:51.110
It won't take long.

35:51.240 --> 35:52.030
Not way.

35:55.530 --> 35:56.860
Look, here's the thing.

35:56.960 --> 35:59.320
My best friend is going to study
at No. 1 High School.

35:59.320 --> 36:01.110
We will probably be placed
in the same class.

36:01.110 --> 36:02.360
I left him a message some time ago.

36:02.360 --> 36:04.090
I wonder if he has replied to it.

36:06.110 --> 36:07.770
If you let me use the computer,

36:08.090 --> 36:09.480
I promise I'll man the store

36:09.480 --> 36:10.740
and listen to you more.

36:12.130 --> 36:12.820
No.

36:19.380 --> 36:21.640
Cramming on your holiday homework, huh?

36:21.940 --> 36:23.000
Do you need my help?

36:26.300 --> 36:26.960
Lin Zhixia,

36:28.090 --> 36:30.670
I'm previewing the courses
for the new semester.

36:30.670 --> 36:32.870
Did I ask for your help with my homework?

36:34.210 --> 36:34.820
The way you talk

36:34.820 --> 36:37.420
explains why you don't have a friend.
You know?

36:37.630 --> 36:39.030
How do I not have a friend?

36:39.130 --> 36:42.220
My friend will transfer to our school
when the semester begins.

36:42.220 --> 36:44.020
Okay, let's not talk about this.

36:45.310 --> 36:47.240
We weren't in the same school before.

36:47.240 --> 36:49.480
But you'll be at No. 1 High School
when the new semester begins.

36:49.480 --> 36:50.400
While you're there,

36:50.400 --> 36:52.960
do not tell anyone
that I'm your older brother.

36:52.960 --> 36:53.530
Why?

36:53.730 --> 36:54.750
Many questions in this world

36:54.750 --> 36:55.880
cannot be answered.

36:56.230 --> 36:57.090
Just don't ask.

36:59.420 --> 37:00.480
You mean we won't be

37:00.780 --> 37:03.380
siblings anymore
when I go to No. 1 High School?

37:04.090 --> 37:06.610
Lin Zhixia, you've grown up.

37:06.900 --> 37:08.880
It's time you had your own friends.

37:09.010 --> 37:11.190
Stop clinging to me, alright?

37:13.210 --> 37:14.030
Fine, I will.

37:21.860 --> 37:23.860
I won't acknowledge you as my brother.

37:23.860 --> 37:24.880
But don't you forget

37:24.880 --> 37:27.050
many people in the vicinity
also go to No. 1 High School.

37:27.050 --> 37:30.010
Tang Tingting and Duan Qiyan both know
you're my brother.

37:30.010 --> 37:31.540
You can't escape your fate.

37:56.210 --> 37:57.530
On this planet,

37:58.250 --> 38:02.940
[Human Observation Diary]

37:58.590 --> 38:00.250
most people just cross paths.

38:01.170 --> 38:02.830
Only a few stay for a lifetime.

38:07.340 --> 38:08.610
In the fourth grade,

38:09.090 --> 38:10.960
over those 275 days,

38:11.940 --> 38:14.920
we became bosom friends from strangers.

38:19.690 --> 38:21.250
Up till today, it has been five years.

38:21.250 --> 38:25.120
[Human Observation Diary]

38:21.630 --> 38:23.380
I wonder if that rare miracle

38:24.010 --> 38:25.210
will happen

38:26.340 --> 38:27.780
for me again.

38:28.550 --> 38:29.570
[Human Observation Diary]

38:46.150 --> 38:47.690
Attention, all students!

38:47.980 --> 38:49.900
Attention, all teachers!

38:50.300 --> 38:52.010
Lin Zeqiu is my older brother.

38:53.010 --> 38:55.300
I often help him with his homework.

38:55.460 --> 38:57.300
He ranked tenth in his class

38:57.460 --> 38:59.050
simply because I tutored him

38:59.050 --> 39:00.780
back in junior high.

39:01.090 --> 39:02.640
My older brother is my student.

39:02.640 --> 39:05.360
My older brother is my student!

39:34.170 --> 39:35.210
She left so early?

39:42.230 --> 39:43.760
Today is the first day of school.

39:43.760 --> 39:45.360
Nobody is allowed to be late.

39:46.480 --> 39:47.730
Are you silly or what, Duan Qiyan?

39:47.730 --> 39:49.030
You're running late
on the first day of school.

39:49.030 --> 39:49.900
I asked around.

39:49.900 --> 39:52.130
The terrible Director Sui
is on duty today.

39:52.130 --> 39:53.670
Aren't you also running late?

39:53.670 --> 39:55.130
Not if I go faster than you!

39:57.170 --> 39:59.400
[Problem Solving Challenge]

40:05.630 --> 40:07.000
Who's that girl?

40:08.130 --> 40:08.990
Do you know her?

40:10.920 --> 40:12.180
Her name is Jin Baihui,

40:12.320 --> 40:13.720
last year's top student.

40:13.940 --> 40:16.650
She also made it to the youth talent class
in Beijing.

40:16.650 --> 40:18.650
But after studying there
for about six months,

40:18.650 --> 40:20.110
she still couldn't adapt
so she came back.

40:20.110 --> 40:22.980
Then she repeated a grade
and got into the experimental class.

40:22.980 --> 40:25.510
She's said to be
a super test-taking machine.

40:43.300 --> 40:44.560
Please let me through.

40:45.380 --> 40:46.530
Chunlei, what are you doing here?

40:46.530 --> 40:47.420
Class is about to begin.

40:47.420 --> 40:49.000
Aren't we getting new textbooks today?

40:49.000 --> 40:50.630
We can get that stuff anytime.

40:50.630 --> 40:53.290
But this rare clash of titans
is not to be missed.

40:54.210 --> 40:55.710
The former top student
of the experimental class,

40:55.710 --> 40:58.500
namely the boy who made it
to the Yao Class of Qingbei University,

40:58.500 --> 41:00.340
left a question here
before his graduation—

41:00.340 --> 41:02.190
[Problem Solving Challenge]

41:00.530 --> 41:02.550
the Linglong Formation. Have you heard?

41:02.550 --> 41:04.650
These girls are trying to crack it now.

41:04.650 --> 41:07.250
[Battle]

41:11.610 --> 41:12.940
Gosh.

41:14.110 --> 41:15.360
Case analysis.

41:15.570 --> 41:18.760
Identifying the dominant term.

41:19.590 --> 41:21.110
It's hard to come up with this approach.

41:21.110 --> 41:23.510
Besides, it involves so much calculation.

41:32.940 --> 41:34.440
Look, in just a moment,

41:34.440 --> 41:36.640
she has almost filled the entire board.

41:37.510 --> 41:38.500
As expected of her,

41:38.500 --> 41:40.830
solving problems is as easy as breathing.

41:41.110 --> 41:41.840
So enviable.

41:43.010 --> 41:44.980
I was asking about that other girl.

41:47.860 --> 41:49.060
You meant Lin Zhixia?

41:49.260 --> 41:51.230
She went to the same junior high school
with us.

41:51.230 --> 41:52.190
Back then,

41:52.190 --> 41:54.340
we liked to give top students like her
nicknames.

41:54.340 --> 41:55.670
We called the boys "Masters,"

41:55.670 --> 41:57.000
and girls "Immortals."

41:57.460 --> 41:59.000
Lin Zhixia was the brightest

41:59.000 --> 42:02.230
of all immortals in the highest heaven.

42:22.900 --> 42:24.170
Impressive.

42:27.960 --> 42:29.960
Geniuses always act like geniuses.

42:44.550 --> 42:45.010
Hold on.

42:47.780 --> 42:49.500
Where's the calculation process?

42:49.500 --> 42:50.210
Without that,

42:50.210 --> 42:52.140
who knows if you peeped at my answer

42:52.610 --> 42:54.610
and calculated a bit faster than me?

42:55.780 --> 42:58.340
I used the equation of the hyperbola
and integrated algebra with geometry.

42:58.340 --> 42:59.170
It was a simple process.

42:59.170 --> 43:01.500
No need for these many complicated steps.

43:04.690 --> 43:07.150
You call my way of solving it
"complicated"?

43:09.940 --> 43:11.400
I mean, there are various ways

43:11.400 --> 43:12.930
to solve this math problem.

43:13.050 --> 43:14.380
Your answer is correct.

43:14.420 --> 43:16.280
The difference
is just that you made 15 steps,

43:16.280 --> 43:17.280
while I made five.

43:20.940 --> 43:23.170
Humiliating. This is utterly humiliating.

43:23.170 --> 43:24.730
On the very first day of school,

43:24.730 --> 43:26.860
Jin Baihui got crushed without mercy.

43:27.690 --> 43:29.210
As expected of Lin Zhixia,

43:29.460 --> 43:31.520
she's always direct in what she does.

43:36.780 --> 43:38.240
Let me help you improve it.

43:50.890 --> 43:51.900
Let's go. Scatter, guys.

43:51.900 --> 43:53.560
Class is beginning. Let's go.

44:14.890 --> 44:18.420
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

44:23.090 --> 44:24.210
We're desk mates again.

44:24.210 --> 44:25.460
This is great.

44:33.440 --> 44:34.700
These seats are taken.

44:35.740 --> 44:39.550
[Reading Corner]

44:43.340 --> 44:44.400
Why did you do that?

44:45.480 --> 44:48.740
I merely made it into
the experimental class in last place.

44:50.340 --> 44:52.740
Behind us, there is already an "Immortal."

44:53.090 --> 44:54.780
If Lin Zhixia took the seat
in front of me,

44:54.780 --> 44:57.310
wouldn't I be crushed
like a sandwich cookie?

45:08.690 --> 45:11.060
Human Observation Diary

45:20.050 --> 45:24.620
[Bulletin Board]

45:22.840 --> 45:23.530
Here.

45:23.530 --> 45:24.590
It has one here too.

45:24.940 --> 45:26.280
The inside is like this.

45:26.550 --> 45:28.100
[Bulletin Board]

45:43.780 --> 45:44.570
Hello, everyone,

45:44.570 --> 45:46.210
welcome to the experimental class.

45:46.210 --> 45:48.170
My name is Kong Yuanyuan,
your homeroom teacher,

45:48.170 --> 45:50.000
as well as your math teacher.

45:55.530 --> 45:57.650
Now I will start calling the roll
by student numbers.

45:57.650 --> 45:59.380
Take this chance
to get to know each other,

45:59.380 --> 45:59.910
will you?

46:00.260 --> 46:01.500
Okay.
Okay.

46:01.800 --> 46:02.530
Lin Zhixia.

46:03.340 --> 46:03.870
Here I am.

46:05.420 --> 46:06.510
So you are Lin Zhixia.

46:06.510 --> 46:06.920
Good.

46:07.630 --> 46:08.500
Jiang Yubai.

46:11.940 --> 46:12.670
Jiang Yubai?

46:13.570 --> 46:14.370
Is he not here?

46:16.300 --> 46:17.160
Chen Zhenghao.

46:17.260 --> 46:17.730
Here.

46:18.630 --> 46:19.360
Wang Qingyu.

46:19.550 --> 46:19.960
Here.

46:20.530 --> 46:21.260
May I come in?

46:23.570 --> 46:25.000
Being late on the first day, huh?

46:25.000 --> 46:26.000
What's your name?

46:26.460 --> 46:27.070
Jiang Yubai.
